Subject: Re: [chrono] Quaternion question
From: Radu Serban
Date: Thu, 23 Jan 2020 06:57:48 +0000

Assuming point_abs_init is the reference point at startup, expressed in the global (absolute) frame, you can simply:

  1.  express the reference point in the body frame (at startup):
auto point_rel = body->TransformPointParentToLocal(point_abs_init);

  2.  express the reference point in the global frame (within the simulation loop):
auto point_abs = body->TransformPointLocalToParent(point_rel);

--Radu


